I had this fixed once! Had a hard drive crash Monday and one
of the things lost was the adjustment I had made to make the
dark blue color light enough to see. Now my text (and all
the dungeon walls and unlit corridors of course) is magenta!

Using Windows XP, here's what I did.

Left click on the little shield in the upper left hand
corner.
Select Properties
Select Screen Text
Select Blue (second box, right beside Black)
Add in 32 red and 32 green)
Click on OK and select Save Properties for future windows
with the same title.
Repeat and select Gray (128,128,128) for the Screen Text

